    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, it's me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm here to ask you to put this concert on hold. Or at least, don't let Ebenholz and Kreide play together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Something terrible is going to happen in the Afterglow if those two play together!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So if what you're saying is true, my recent improvement was due to this so-called 'false recovery' caused by Ebenholz and Kreide. And as soon as this phase is over, I'll become critically ill and my life will be in danger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. You've been around them a lot, so the symptoms will also be a lot more pronounced.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Others who've had less contact with them are also affected, and if I let the two of them play together, there's a high possibility that people will die?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct. Even though I don't know the exact reason, having the two play together seems to amplify the effect they have on their surroundings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How likely are we talking about here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't say for sure right now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Other than me, who else is in life-threatening danger?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Over a dozen people from the Afterglow have already been hospitalized in the Cliffy Patio.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Cliffy Patio... In other words, they've already left Ebenholz and Kreide's effective range?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That should be the case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I have a clear picture of the situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your answer...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...is no.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not asking you to cancel the whole concert. You can just cut Ebenholz and Kreide's part, or even have someone else perform the duet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you can prove that their duet will cause harm to people other than me, then I'll cancel the concert right away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it seems that's not the case. Even you have no idea what would happen if they played together. I can't simply throw away the efforts and aspirations of everyone in the Afterglow over these illusory 'concerns.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The efforts and aspirations...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand how much this concert means to you, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't understand anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you truly understood, you wouldn't throw around the word 'but' so lightly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, I cannot change the concert schedule on your word alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Czerny, please give me a straight answer. What makes this concert more important than the lives of the Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you suggesting that I'm disregarding peoples' lives?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Czerny"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4047_pianst_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just saying\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hibiscus! Hibiscus!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursula"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ms. Ursula?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Come take a little stroll, won't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursula"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_489_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Come now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursula"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's head out and calm down first. We can talk about this later, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ursula"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
